01:04:39,960 --> 01:04:40,480
(Can only grab the one in front)

1942
01:04:40,480 --> 01:04:41,360
Nai.

1943
01:04:41,760 --> 01:04:43,200
Fei is about to go in.

1944
01:04:44,040 --> 01:04:45,520
Fei is about to go in.

1945
01:04:45,520 --> 01:04:46,360
I can't see.

1946
01:04:49,887 --> 01:04:52,026
(Night vision mode)

1947
01:04:52,890 --> 01:04:54,000
