Exactly.

1953
01:05:04,240 --> 01:05:05,200
Let me go.

1954
01:05:05,200 --> 01:05:07,200
I'll follow you over there.

1955
01:05:07,200 --> 01:05:08,480
Let's bring Yuwen along.

1956
01:05:08,480 --> 01:05:09,080
Okay.

1957
01:05:09,080 --> 01:05:09,552
