Let's go.

1958
01:05:10,040 --> 01:05:10,781
You hold my hand.

1959
01:05:10,781 --> 01:05:11,280
Let's go.

1960
01:05:11,280 --> 01:05:12,200
Don't button your shirt.

1961
01:05:12,200 --> 01:05:12,920
I won't.

1962
01:05:12,920 --> 01:05:13,399
Okay.

1963
01:05:13,680 --> 01:05:14,280
Pull me up.

1964
01:05:14,927 --> 01:05:15,400
Pull me up.

1965
01:05:16,760 --> 01:05:17,520
I have to take it off.

1966
01:05:18,560 --> 01:05:19,280
I have to take it off.

1967
01:05:19,812 --> 01:05:21,204
(Starting over again)

1968
01:05:25,360 --> 01:05:26,360
You can't blame me for that.

1969
01:05:27,920 --> 01:05:29,240
I'm actually helping you here.

1970
01:05:32,156 --> 01:05:33,620
(The situation is dire)

1971
01:05:38,245 --> 01:05:39,937
(Tears wiped, battle on)

1972
01:05:46,327 --> 01:05:47,578
(Lights out)

1973
01:05:50,880 --> 01:05:54,000
