1974
01:05:54,000 --> 01:05:55,240
Too fast.

1975
01:05:58,640 --> 01:06:00,200
This is terrifying.

1976
01:06:00,840 --> 01:06:01,640
Impressive.

1977
01:06:01,842 --> 01:06:03,262
(Lights out)

1978
01:06:04,088 --> 01:06:04,902
(Encircled again)

1979
01:06:06,520 --> 01:06:07,640
So fast.

1980
01:06:13,120 --> 01:06:15,240
Won't this wake you up
