1981
01:06:18,400 --> 01:06:20,200
This is scarier than a ghost, I think.

1982
01:06:22,222 --> 01:06:23,160
(Lights out)

1983
01:06:23,160 --> 01:06:23,920
Who is it?

1984
01:06:26,427 --> 01:06:28,864
(What's going on?)

1985
01:06:29,213 --> 01:06:31,172
(Why are you grabbing my collar?)

1986
01:06:33,000 --> 01:06:34,111
I'm telling you.

1987
01:06:34,440 --> 01:06:35,760
The human heart is unfathomable.

1988
01:06:36,680 --> 01:06:37,560
Xingxu.

1989
01:06:38,000 --> 01:06:39,000
Nai.

1990
01:06:40,440 --> 01:06:40,920
Wen.

1991
01:06:42,160 --> 01:06:42,800
Break free from him.

1992
01:06:44,800 --> 01:06:45,408
Break free from him.

1993
01:06:50,080 --> 01:06:50,880
Break free from him.

1994
01:06:51,640 --> 01:06:53,120
Wait, what about you then?

1995
01:06:56,200 --> 01:06:56,640
You

1996
01:06:57,000 --> 01:06:58,160
