1997
01:06:58,160 --> 01:06:58,680
Villain.

1998
01:07:00,680 --> 01:07:01,120
Wen,

1999
01:07:01,320 --> 01:07:02,120
break free from him.

2000
01:07:02,440 --> 01:07:03,320
What about you then?

2001
01:07:04,360 --> 01:07:05,400
(I became the villain?)
Do I have any lines?

2002
01:07:05,920 --> 01:07:07,200
You all have to die today.

2003
01:07:09,640 --> 01:07:10,833
I want to curse.

2004
01:07:17,520 --> 01:07:18,400
Xingxu.

2005
01:07:18,400 --> 01:07:19,400
Nai.

2006
01:07:20,880 --> 01:07:22,680
I'm helping you, Xingxu.

2007
01:07:25,560 --> 01:07:26,880
The world is a cold place.

2008
01:07:29,761 --> 01:07:31,789
(Night vision mode)

2009
01:07:45,560 --> 01:07:46,720
Why?

2010
01:07:47,760 --> 01:07:49,000
Xingxu, why?

2011
01:07:49,560 --> 01:07:50,160
Tell me.

2012
01:07:50,160 --> 01:07:51,280
Give me a reason. Why?

2013
01:07:51,920 --> 01:07:52,600
You messed with him.

2014
01:07:52,600 --> 01:07:54,000
You kept messing with him just now.

2015
01:07:54,560 --> 01:07:55,760
He messed with me earlier too.

2016
01:07:55,760 --> 01:07:56,840
Later, I stopped messing with him.

2017
01:07:57,800 --> 01:07:58,080
Xingxu.

2018
01:07:58,375 --> 01:08:00,199
(Lights out)

2019
01:08:07,120 --> 01:08:07,640
Xingxu.

2020
01:08:08,320 --> 01:08:09,720
The ravaged lead villain.

2021
01:08:09,760 --> 01:08:10,800
How about the three of us do this?

2022
01:08:11,400 --> 01:08:12,240
Just listen to me.

2023
01:08:12,760 --> 01:08:15,160
Let's each take a step back.

2024
01:08:17,600 --> 01:08:19,040
We all go back to the start.

2025
01:08:19,040 --> 01:08:20,120
(Lights out)
Then we compete on speed on our own.

2026
01:08:21,000 --> 01:08:21,600
- Wait a moment.
- I mean it.

2027
01:08:21,600 --> 01:08:22,359
No, Nai.

2028
01:08:22,359 --> 01:08:23,279
I only have one button left.

2029
01:08:25,543 --> 01:08:27,623
