2032
01:08:30,680 --> 01:08:31,920
Why are you grabbing my shirt?

2033
01:08:33,200 --> 01:08:34,120
You are grabbing...

2034
01:08:34,120 --> 01:08:35,680
Whose shirt are you grabbing then?

2035
01:08:35,680 --> 01:08:36,399
You two first...

2036
01:08:36,399 --> 01:08:38,359
Let me get my left leg out first
in a moment.

2037
01:08:41,040 --> 01:08:42,680
Let's not talk like that.

2038
01:08:42,680 --> 01:08:43,120
It hurts.

2039
01:08:43,120 --> 01:08:43,640
Xingxu,

2040
01:08:43,640 --> 01:08:44,399
I feel for you.

2041
01:08:44,680 --> 01:08:45,680
As an older brother,

2042
01:08:45,680 --> 01:08:46,160
let me tell you,

2043
01:08:46,160 --> 01:08:47,319
at the critical moment,

2044
01:08:47,319 --> 01:08:48,080
I should care

2045
01:08:48,080 --> 01:08:49,479
(Lights out)
for my younger brother.

2046
01:08:49,600 --> 01:08:50,319
Why are the lights out?

2047
01:08:52,461 --> 01:08:53,925
(Where's Wen?)

2048
01:08:57,120 --> 01:08:58,479
Xingxu, look.

2049
01:08:58,479 --> 01:08:59,160
Wen.

2050
01:08:59,160 --> 01:09:00,319
Do you see that?

2051
01:09:01,080 --> 01:09:01,680
Wen.

2052
01:09:09,760 --> 01:09:10,479
Wen,

2053
01:09:10,479 --> 01:09:11,240
break free from him.

2054
01:09:11,399 --> 01:09:13,359
What about you then?

2055
01:09:14,960 --> 01:09:15,920
I'll put mine on first,

2056
01:09:15,920 --> 01:09:17,040
