2057
01:09:20,319 --> 01:09:20,760
Xingxu,

2058
01:09:20,880 --> 01:09:22,200
do you think she will?

2059
01:09:22,640 --> 01:09:23,600
Xingxu, think about it.

2060
01:09:23,920 --> 01:09:24,640
Just now,

2061
01:09:25,080 --> 01:09:26,040
when you messed with me,

2062
01:09:26,040 --> 01:09:27,040
I didn't blame you.

2063
01:09:29,040 --> 01:09:30,279
Wasn't I helping you

2064
01:09:30,760 --> 01:09:31,479
