2065
01:09:32,040 --> 01:09:32,399
Yes.

2066
01:09:33,359 --> 01:09:34,439
You know what to do now, right?

2067
01:09:36,120 --> 01:09:37,819
Xingxu, listen to my strategy.

2068
01:09:38,240 --> 01:09:39,160
After I finish buttoning,

2069
01:09:39,160 --> 01:09:41,242
I'll bring your shirt over for you.

2070
01:09:41,439 --> 01:09:42,760
You control Nai.

2071
01:09:42,760 --> 01:09:43,399
Once you put it on,

2072
01:09:43,399 --> 01:09:44,605
