2073
01:09:44,840 --> 01:09:46,200
This risk is very, very big.

2074
01:09:46,200 --> 01:09:47,359
Because when you're
reaching for his shirt,

2075
01:09:47,359 --> 01:09:48,399
the lights could come on

2076
01:09:48,399 --> 01:09:49,147
while you're moving.

2077
01:09:49,399 --> 01:09:50,479
Then you'd have to take your shirt off.

2078
01:09:50,479 --> 01:09:51,720
So I suggest you

2079
01:09:51,720 --> 01:09:52,279
come in.

2080
01:09:57,840 --> 01:09:59,200
This risk is very, very big.

2081
01:10:03,600 --> 01:10:04,400
(Lights out)
Xingxu.

2082
01:10:04,400 --> 01:10:04,960
Come in quickly.

2083
01:10:13,200 --> 01:10:13,760
(Without hesitation.)
Come in quickly.

2084
01:10:30,280 --> 01:10:31,480
Very touching.

2085
01:10:31,480 --> 01:10:32,840
You pounced really accurately.

2086
01:10:34,000 --> 01:10:34,400
Right?

2087
01:10:35,840 --> 01:10:36,560
Where is she?

2088
01:10:36,560 --> 01:10:36,920
Where?

2089
01:10:37,006 --> 01:10:38,400
(Lights out)

2090
01:10:38,400 --> 01:10:39,160
Nai.

2091
01:10:42,520 --> 01:10:43,600
So tragically beautiful.

2092
01:10:49,874 --> 01:10:50,400
Xingxu,

2093
01:10:50,400 --> 01:10:50,920
I suggest you

2094
01:10:50,920 --> 01:10:51,840
put your shirt on first.

2095
01:10:51,840 --> 01:10:53,040
Put it on first.

2096
01:10:53,040 --> 01:10:55,000
Only by putting it on can you fight.

2097
01:10:55,680 --> 01:10:56,600
Villain.

2098
01:10:56,920 --> 01:10:58,240
This is a villain.

2099
01:10:58,240 --> 01:10:58,880
You guys

2100
01:10:58,880 --> 01:10:59,440
