2101
01:11:00,262 --> 01:11:01,400
(Lights out)

2102
01:11:01,400 --> 01:11:01,960
Go quickly.

2103
01:11:02,920 --> 01:11:04,320
Trying to be the hero saving the damsel?

2104
01:11:15,040 --> 01:11:16,960
(Lights out)
Xingxu, put on your shirt quickly.

2105
01:11:18,591 --> 01:11:20,109
(Successfully got the shirt)

2106
01:11:20,440 --> 01:11:22,480
Why are you buttoning your own shirt?

2107
01:11:22,684 --> 01:11:23,732
(Buttoned wrong)

2108
01:11:24,320 --> 01:11:25,720
(Lights out)
Someone has to lose, Nai.

2109
01:11:27,889 --> 01:11:28,712
(I can't lose)

2110
01:11:28,776 --> 01:11:29,963
(Progress synced)

2111
01:11:30,960 --> 01:11:32,400
(Lights out)
I think it's time to see who's faster.

2112
01:11:41,035 --> 01:11:41,911
(Lights out)

2113
01:11:45,680 --> 01:11:46,920
How did she see?

2114
01:11:47,744 --> 01:11:48,880
(Guarding)

2115
01:11:48,880 --> 01:11:50,280
In the martial world, there's a skill

2116
01:11:50,280 --> 01:11:51,440
