2117
01:11:52,915 --> 01:11:54,898
(Night vision mode)

2118
01:11:57,320 --> 01:11:58,200
Are you still putting it on, Nai?

2119
01:11:58,640 --> 01:11:59,440
Nai, are you still putting it on?

2120
01:12:02,912 --> 01:12:04,152
(Only one button left)

2121
01:12:07,040 --> 01:12:07,600
Get up quickly.

2122
01:12:08,280 --> 01:12:09,200
(Lights out)
You'll get hurt, kid.

2123
01:12:11,291 --> 01:12:12,830
(How did he get in?)

2124
01:12:13,002 --> 01:12:14,529
(I completed the mission)

2125
01:12:17,880 --> 01:12:18,560
You didn't button it.

2126
01:12:18,560 --> 01:12:19,200
You didn't button it right.

2127
01:12:19,200 --> 01:12:19,920
You didn't button it.

2128
01:12:19,920 --> 01:12:22,064
(All buttons are misaligned)

2129
01:12:22,240 --> 01:12:23,960
You buttoned them all wrong.

2130
01:12:23,960 --> 01:12:25,520
I don't know how to button.

2131
01:12:26,336 --> 01:12:27,878
(Only one button left)

2132
01:12:31,560 --> 01:12:32,400
All buttoned correctly.

2133
01:12:33,600 --> 01:12:35,400
The key is you have to
unbutton them all.

2134
01:12:36,120 --> 01:12:37,120
They are all wrong.

2135
01:12:39,287 --> 01:12:40,078
(Lights out)

2136
01:12:42,560 --> 01:12:43,640
Why is it still you?

2137
01:12:44,600 --> 01:12:45,800
(Why is it always you?)
Then who else could it be?

2138
01:12:46,400 --> 01:12:47,440
Hold on just a little longer.

2139
01:12:47,440 --> 01:12:48,600
Xingxu will have them all buttoned.

2140
01:12:49,080 --> 01:12:49,840
Just one left.

2141
01:12:50,482 --> 01:12:51,040
(Lights out)

2142
01:12:51,040 --> 01:12:52,240
Nai.

2143
01:12:54,600 --> 01:12:55,320
(Locked on)
Such core strength.

2144
01:12:57,440 --> 01:12:58,440
Li Naiwen,

2145
01:12:58,440 --> 01:13:00,120
