2146
01:13:00,120 --> 01:13:00,806
(Never Give Up)

2147
01:13:01,020 --> 01:13:01,920
(Lights out)

2148
01:13:01,920 --> 01:13:03,240
Nai, there's no need.

2149
01:13:04,880 --> 01:13:05,960
Aren't we doing just fine?

2150
01:13:09,600 --> 01:13:10,960
Let's bring him in together.

2151
01:13:10,960 --> 01:13:12,200
Right.

2152
01:13:14,204 --> 01:13:15,716
(Night vision mode)

2153
01:13:19,790 --> 01:13:20,856
(Wang Yuwen and Chen Xingxu
completed the mission)

2154
01:13:23,440 --> 01:13:24,360
You cooperated very well.

2155
01:13:25,200 --> 01:13:26,640
Brilliant.

2156
01:13:27,200 --> 01:13:28,160
Sit for a while.

2157
01:13:31,200 --> 01:13:31,920
Sit for a while.

2158
01:13:33,320 --> 01:13:34,080
So, as I was saying,

2159
01:13:35,720 --> 01:13:37,640
