2162
01:13:41,010 --> 01:13:41,720
(Nai is strong and vigorous)

2163
01:13:41,720 --> 01:13:42,840
Too good.

2164
01:13:43,080 --> 01:13:44,120
The reward for first place.

2165
01:13:48,920 --> 01:13:50,840
Isn't it supposed to move when you clap?

2166
01:13:51,640 --> 01:13:52,360
Open it.

2167
01:13:54,040 --> 01:13:55,160
They gave me Lin Yi.

2168
01:13:56,040 --> 01:13:57,333
I'm feeling a bit emotional right now.

2169
01:13:57,680 --> 01:14:00,120
Because I've been
silently missing you all.

2170
01:14:00,120 --> 01:14:02,142
Everyone, miss me
while you're in South France.

2171
01:14:02,480 --> 01:14:04,000
He said to miss him in South France.

2172
01:14:04,520 --> 01:14:05,920
He said he's feeling
emotional right now.

2173
01:14:05,920 --> 01:14:06,640
We will.

2174
01:14:06,640 --> 01:14:07,480
Don't worry.

2175
01:14:07,480 --> 01:14:08,200
Alright.

2176
01:14:08,200 --> 01:14:09,360
Okay, I'll keep it.

2177
01:14:09,360 --> 01:14:09,960
Lin Yi.

2178
01:14:09,960 --> 01:14:10,382
Stop that.

2179
01:14:11,080 --> 01:14:12,840
If you want to play,
win the game next time. Come on.

2180
01:14:12,840 --> 01:14:14,600
Without you here, I lost.

2181
01:14:19,080 --> 01:14:20,360
He's mocking you. Did you hear that?

2182
01:14:25,584 --> 01:14:26,560
(Will be back next week)

2183
01:14:26,560 --> 01:14:28,720
Goodnight, Makka Pakka.

2184
01:14:40,920 --> 01:14:42,240
(Next Episode Preview)
Wow The World.

2185
01:14:42,240 --> 01:14:43,480
The lavender is right here.

2186
01:14:43,880 --> 01:14:45,000
These plates are all very pretty.

2187
01:14:45,000 --> 01:14:46,360
I want to buy a fridge magnet.

2188
01:14:47,480 --> 01:14:48,320
I can't get out.

2189
01:14:48,640 --> 01:14:50,960
I think driving it is different.

2190
01:14:51,480 --> 01:14:52,200
Come on, let's race.

2191
01:14:52,840 --> 01:14:53,920
I can drive forever.

2192
01:14:54,960 --> 01:14:56,360
Circle-Covering Dance.

2193
01:14:56,360 --> 01:14:58,080
We need to find a way
to cover this circle.

2194
01:14:58,080 --> 01:14:59,440
I'll act "written all over the face".

2195
01:14:59,440 --> 01:15:00,160
Let's all act "nervous".

2196
01:15:00,160 --> 01:15:01,040
Don't relax at all.

2197
01:15:02,720 --> 01:15:04,400
Come on, roll over me.

2198
01:15:04,400 --> 01:15:05,360
Deng Kai.

2199
01:15:05,360 --> 01:15:06,760
Deng Kai is very suspicious.

2200
01:15:13,460 --> 01:15:14,651
(Which team will win?)

2201
01:15:14,680 --> 01:15:16,560
Next, sing while wearing
noise-jamming headphones.

2202
01:15:16,560 --> 01:15:19,880
♪Silently♪

2203
01:15:20,480 --> 01:15:21,560
♪Crying♪

2204
01:15:21,560 --> 01:15:26,840
♪Annie, I can't lose you♪

2205
01:15:26,840 --> 01:15:29,280
Nai, you're legendary.

2206
01:15:30,360 --> 01:15:31,160
Why is there no mic?

2207
01:15:32,240 --> 01:15:33,640
No sound came out.

2208
01:15:33,920 --> 01:15:37,960
♪How could I blame you
for your mistakes?♪

2209
01:15:37,960 --> 01:15:39,560
Wen, you should be really good at music.

2210
01:15:39,560 --> 01:15:40,600
But this time, you sang...

2211
01:15:41,400 --> 01:15:43,840
You've never been this mean
to me before.

2212
01:15:44,797 --> 01:15:45,640
(Which team has
the better song execution?)

2213
01:15:45,640 --> 01:15:46,960
Welcome to Chengdu.

2214
01:15:46,960 --> 01:15:47,960
Do we start like this?

2215
01:15:47,960 --> 01:15:49,760
This really looks like
we three are sleeping here.

2216
01:15:50,800 --> 01:15:51,560
Come on, squeeze in.

2217
01:15:51,560 --> 01:15:54,000
You need to meet up with He

2218
01:15:54,000 --> 01:15:54,760
and wake him up.

2219
01:15:55,400 --> 01:15:55,920
Sir.

2220
