2240
01:16:24,920 --> 01:16:25,720
So cute.

2241
01:16:26,120 --> 01:16:27,520
Yarn-Spinning Time.

2242
01:16:27,680 --> 01:16:28,600
You think

2243
01:16:28,600 --> 01:16:30,160
