Ingrown nail.

2252
01:16:45,560 --> 01:16:47,120
It hurts so much.

2253
01:16:49,160 --> 01:16:49,960
So unified?

2254
01:16:49,960 --> 01:16:51,200
The ceiling is dripping water.

2255
01:16:51,806 --> 01:16:52,360
