2256
01:16:52,360 --> 01:16:53,520
Always Smiling.

2257
01:16:53,520 --> 01:16:54,680
Ball.

2258
01:16:54,680 --> 01:16:55,560
Bao.

2259
01:16:55,560 --> 01:16:56,360
Me.

2260
01:16:57,920 --> 01:16:58,840
So difficult.

2261
01:16:58,840 --> 01:17:02,280
Wet.

2262
01:17:04,040 --> 01:17:04,720
Light.

2263
01:17:06,040 --> 01:17:07,240
Useless too.

2264
