2266
01:17:11,386 --> 01:17:12,440
(Extra Episode preview)
Performance in the palm.

2267
01:17:12,440 --> 01:17:13,320
I'm extremely fast.

2268
01:17:13,520 --> 01:17:14,154
Really fast?

2269
01:17:16,720 --> 01:17:23,480
